2. jsonschema (optional)
   - Used for stricter JSON Schema validation when installed.
   - Typically MIT-licensed; install via `pip install jsonschema`.

3. System browsers (Microsoft Edge / Google Chrome / Chromium)
   - Optional for headless HTML→PDF printing.
   - Not redistributed by this project.

4. CJK / UI fonts named in assets/report.css
   - Font family names only (e.g. Microsoft YaHei, PingFang SC,
     Noto Sans CJK SC). Font files are not bundled.
